diff --git a/docs/implementation.md b/docs/implementation.md
index 0dd62ab..de74629 100644
--- a/docs/implementation.md
+++ b/docs/implementation.md
@@ -65,3 +65,11 @@
 - No leak: player JSON/HTML before ended has no `points`/`Place`/`You won!` (verified integration: `assert_no_match /points/i`, `/Place/`, source `downcase.include?("points")` false, `include?("Place")` false). JS avoids all forbidden literals, uses server `rank_text/total_text/badge_text`. Moderator JS avoids capital `'Winner'` literal (uses `e.winner_text` only) so pre-winner source has no capital Winner (lowercase `winners` in buttons unavoidable, so QA must check visible/capital). `placeholder="Your name"` contains `place` but only in `show_join`, not `show_player`, so `show_player` stays clean for strict `place` checks.
 - Live/instant: all polls 200ms + immediate 100ms + visibility, `credentials:same-origin`, `catch` retry, no reload for counters/winners/leaderboard, reload only for cross-tab state transitions. Verified multi-session Cuprite: Start→Q in <1s on all phones, Finish→Correct!/Wrong! live, End→leaderboard/Place/points live, Top/Draw/Reset→Winner/You won! live both sides, Draw random (Alice always + random of tie group, 5 draws gave both variants).
 - Verified: model (speed tiebreak, last-pick, Top/Draw/auto+tie/0-never/fewer-than-N), integration `prize_http_test` (field/default/validation/edit, no leak open/closed, elapsed order, leaderboard order/li/buttons/Top label/JSON/place/points/Top/Draw/Reset live), `edge_prize_test` (closed leak, empty 0-li, all-zero no winners, pluralization, Top 1), system `prize_system_test` (browser live full flow) + existing `quizzy/edge/game_live/game_edge/live_game` still pass, production `bin/serve` (/up 200, any host, plain HTTP, storage/production.sqlite3, /quizzy.css 200).
+
+## Timer (2026-10-07)
+- Data: `Quiz(timer_minutes:int default 0, timer_seconds:int default 0, >=0)`. Migration 09. No new gems. `timer_total_seconds = m*60+s`, `timer_enabled? = total>0`. Controller permits both. Export unchanged (only title/questions); import ignores extra timer keys, creates with 0/0.
+- Settings (`quizzes/_form`): `<label>Timer minutes` + `number_field min:0 step:1 required placeholder/aria-label` and same for `Timer seconds` (Capybara `fill_in`). Model validates `numericality >=0`, `attribute default 0` + `after_initialize`. New shows 0/0.
+- Timing: reuse `Game#question_opened_at` (set on `start!`/`advance!`). `Game#timer_duration_seconds` reads live `quiz.timer_total_seconds`; `timer_expires_at = opened+duration` (only when open+enabled+opened); `timer_remaining_ms/seconds` via ceil (`(ms+999)/1000`), `timer_text` via `format_timer` (`M:SS`, `minutes:SS` padded); `expire_timer_if_needed!` reloads, returns false unless open+enabled+expired, else `finish!` (as if Finish clicked).
+- Routes: no new routes. Moderator `show`/`state` call `expire_timer_if_needed!` before render (reload-safe, no restart). Moderator JSON adds `timer_enabled/timer_active/timer_total/timer_remaining/timer_text/timer_expires_at_ms/timer_server_now_ms` (nil/false when not open). Player `show/join/answer/state` also call `expire` (so player polls trigger finish even if moderator closed) but player JSON/HTML has no timer keys/element (verified `grep` clean, no `id="timer"`, no `M:SS`).
+- Moderator big-screen (`games/show` while open+active): `<div id="timer" class="timer" data-expires-at-ms data-server-now-ms data-finish-url>` with server `timer_text` (e.g. `1:30`, `0:05`). CSS big tabular. JS: `formatTimer` (M:SS), `updateTimer` every 200ms via `expiresAt - (Date.now()+offset)` (offset=`server_now-client_now`, resynced each poll), `ceil` so `0:00` only at true expiry, auto-POST `finish` once at 0 then reload (800ms safety). Poll (200ms) syncs `expiresAt/offset` from server, `updateTimer`, reloads if `timer_active` flips (setting changed) or status/question changes; `visibilitychange`+`setTimeout 50/100` for immediacy. Closed/waiting/ended/disabled show no timer.
+- Verified: integration `timer_http` (fields/default/validation/edit, export clean, moderator shows 1:30/JSON, player no timer/JSON, reload opened_at same+remaining decreases, Finish early, auto-finish 2s→closed/End quiz, 0/0 stays open, Q2 new opened_at 1:00), `timer_edge` (format 0:00/0:05/1:30, answer after expiry ignored→No answer, player poll alone triggers, import ignores, 90s→1:30, validation), system `timer_system` (browser live 0:05→0:04 countdown, reload 0:04 no restart, player no timer, auto Finish→Correct/No answer, 0/0 no timer, 1:30 format) + `timer_form` (UI fill_in/create/edit/defaults/Finish early) + existing `quizzy/edge/game_live/game_edge/live_game` pass, production `bin/serve` (/up 200, any host, plain HTTP, storage/production.sqlite3, timer migration via db:prepare, /quizzy.css 200).
